{"unit_id":"342949145__dsh-vision-bridge#card-zh","repo":"342949145/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"da4ef0ca14bcff2cd2c877bca8eaa27f59d414bd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-bridge 是面向网页版 DSH 的图片识别与生成插件。它扩展纯文本模型的图片能力，在请求发往模型前把图片交给阿里云百炼视觉模型转换成文字，并注册 generate_image 工具生成图片。图片转换支持嵌套工具结果、结果缓存和模型回退；生成图片会作为附件返回，也可保存到工作区。适合希望在 DeepSeek 等纯文本模型会话中理解或生成图片的用户。需要配置阿里云百炼 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:227-269","lib/gen.js:184-253"]}
{"unit_id":"342949145__dsh-vision-bridge#card-en","repo":"342949145/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"da4ef0ca14bcff2cd2c877bca8eaa27f59d414bd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-bridge adds image understanding and generation to web DSH sessions. It converts images to text through Aliyun DashScope before model requests and registers a generate_image tool. Results can be cached; generated images return as attachments. A DashScope API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:227-269","lib/gen.js:184-253"]}
